        ("Step B - connected PC, superadmin only", "1. The administrator signs in to the website and opens Admin > Offline demos.\n2. Choose Import device renewal request (JSON) and select the request exported by the target PC. This fills the Device ID and may fill the tenant.\n3. Choose account and confirm Account / tenant ID. A first-time request can have no tenant; the administrator must select the correct account.\n4. Choose Usage policy. Customer / dealer evaluation needs Evaluation days (1-365). Internal team demo has no expiry and is for authorised team PCs only.\n5. Set Concurrent camera entitlement to the approved number. It is a licence ceiling, not a hardware performance promise.\n6. Click Issue and download device licence. The downloaded signed response is normally vantag-demo-entitlement.json. Copy it back to the USB drive."),
